WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:11,140
I agree with everything you just said. I have long seen that Fang Yuqing only wants to rely on others and has never treated you sincerely.

2
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:15,340
When I saw you saving her, I always felt sorry for you. In fact, I have always had a good impression of you in my heart.

3
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,840
Now that you see her clearly, let's try to get along.

4
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:25,840
The standard plastic sisters, when they saw that I was safe and sound, they immediately threw out their girlfriends, and their plans were clearly understood.

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:30,180
Huh, she really thinks I'm someone who doesn't refuse anyone.

6
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:36,900
Apart from feeling too good about himself, Lin Caining really has no redeeming features.

7
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:42,300
Really? But I just made Fang Yuqing speechless. Don't you have a very good relationship?

8
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:45,600
If you come to my side, it won't affect the relationship between the two of you.
